\t      SJ correlation, and how does this relate to type frequency and structural complexity.\n52\t      Include bootstrap confidence intervals for all rho comparisons (SJ vs FK).\n53\t    priority: P0\n54\t    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n55\t    deps: []\n56\t    note: CPU-only analysis on existing data. Bootstrap CI for rho differences.\n57\t\n58\t  - id: exp-005\n59\t    name: temperature_sensitivity_analysis\n60\t    claim: 2\n61\t    description: >\n62\t      Systematic comparison of T=0.7 vs T=1.0 on both NER and RE.\n63\t      Analyze signal-noise tradeoff: T=0.7 reduces diversity (oracle headroom)\n64\t      but improves signal quality (conditional rho). Data already exists\n65\t      from pilot_004 (T=1.0) and pilot_005 (T=0.7).\n66\t    priority: P0\n67\t    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n68\t    deps: []\n69\t    note: CPU-only analysis on existing data\n70\t\n71\t  # === P1: Important, strongly recommended ===\n72\t\n73\t  - id: exp-006\n74\t    name: adaptive_compute_demo\n75\t    claim: 1\n76\t    description: >\n77\t      Demonstrate concrete TTS improvement on NER: compare F1 of\n78\t      SJ-based best-of-N selection vs FK-based vs random vs greedy.\n79\t      Show that SJ-guided selection outperforms alternatives.\n80\t      This is the \"practical impact\" evidence — without it, headline result has no F1 number.\n81\t    priority: P0\n82\t    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n83\t    deps: [exp-001]\n84\t    note: CPU-only, uses N=16 samples from exp-001. Upgraded from P1 per Reviewer feedback.\n85\t\n86\t  - id: exp-007\n87\t    name: ner_multi_model\n88\t    claim: 1\n89\t    description: >\n90\t      NER pilot with a different model family (LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct)\n91\t      on SciERC to show the effect is model-agnostic. Main Conference\n92\t      reviewers will almost certainly ask about single-model limitation.\n93\t    priority: P0\n94\t    gpu_budget_hours: 15\n95\t    deps: []\n96\t    dataset: SciERC\n97\t    model: llama-3.1-8b (new fine-tune)\n98\t    note: Upgraded from P1 per Reviewer feedback — R2 is a near-certain reviewer question.\n99\t\n100\t  - id: exp-008\n101\t    name: re_n16_confirmation\n102\t    claim: 2\n103\t    description: >\n104\t      RE N=16 on SciERC to confirm negative finding with higher statistical power.\n105\t      Also tests whether N=16 changes the SJ vs FK comparison on RE.\n106\t    priority: P1\n107\t    gpu_budget_hours: 12\n108\t    deps: []\n109\t    dataset: SciERC\n110\t    model: ft_002_v2\n111\t\n112\t  - id: exp-009\n113\t    name: capability_stratification\n114\t    claim: 2\n115\t    description: >\n116\t      Stratify instances by difficulty (greedy F1 buckets) for both NER and RE.\n117\t      Analyze how rho varies across difficulty strata — does the\n118\t      capability-dependent pattern hold across subtasks?\n119\t    priority: P1\n120\t    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n121\t    deps: [exp-001]\n122\t    note: CPU-only analysis\n123\t\n124\t  # === P2: Nice-to-have ===\n125\t\n126\t  - id: exp-010\n127\t    name: selection_curves\n128\t    claim: 1\n129\t    description: >\n130\t      Best-of-N selection curves for N=1,2,4,8,16 comparing SJ vs FK vs random\n131\t      on NER. Visualize how F1 scales with compute budget under different\n132\t      confidence signals.\n133\t    priority: P2\n134\t    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n135\t    deps: [exp-001]\n136\t    note: CPU-only visualization\n137\t\n138\t  - id: exp-011\n139\t    name: ner_ood_robustness\n140\t    claim: 1\n141\t    description: >\n142\t      Test NER consistency signal on out-of-distribution instances\n143\t      (e.g., different domains within OntoNotes, or cross-domain transfer).\n144\t    priority: P2\n145\t    gpu_budget_hours: 5\n146\t    deps: [exp-003]\n147\t\n148\t# GPU Budget Summary (updated):\n149\t# P0: 51 GPU-hours (exp-001: 18h [3 seeds], exp-002: 8h, exp-003: 10h, exp-004/005/006: 0h, exp-007: 15h)\n150\t# P1: 12 GPU-hours (exp-008: 12h, exp-009: 0h)\n151\t# P2: 5 GPU-hours (exp-010: 0h, exp-011: 5h)\n152\t# Total P0: 51 GPU-hours\n153\t# Available: 8x RTX 5090 = ~192 GPU-hours/day → P0 completable in ~1 day with parallel execution\n154\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8fc9b383-c417-43bc-b48d-b0a1903064d9","uuid":"5b543e89-013a-4869-88f0-e88b1cec64a8","timestamp":"2026-05-14T09:47:33.848Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/experiment_plan.yaml","content":"experiments:\n  # === P0: Must-run for submission ===\n\n  - id: exp-001\n    name: ner_n16_scierc\n    claim: 1\n    description: >\n      NER N=16 on SciERC (ft_002_v2 model) to strengthen rho estimation\n      and test whether increased samples push rho past 0.40.\n      Also provides N-scaling data (N=8 vs N=16).\n      Run with seeds [42, 123, 456] for robustness validation.\n    priority: P0\n    gpu_budget_hours: 18\n    deps: []\n    dataset: SciERC\n    model: ft_002_v2\n    note: 3 seeds × 6h each; primary seed=42, secondary seeds for rho stability check\n\n  - id: exp-002\n    name: ner_conll2003\n    claim: 1\n    description: >\n      Fine-tune Qwen3-8B on CoNLL-2003 (LoRA) + NER pilot (N=8, T=0.7)\n      to validate cross-dataset generalization of Claim 1.\n    priority: P0\n    gpu_budget_hours: 8\n    deps: []\n    dataset: CoNLL-2003\n    model: qwen3-8b (new fine-tune)\n\n  - id: exp-003\n    name: ner_dataset3\n    claim: 1\n    description: >\n      Fine-tune Qwen3-8B on third NER dataset (LoRA) + NER pilot (N=8, T=0.7)\n      to validate cross-dataset generalization of Claim 1.\n      Dataset: OntoNotes 5.0 if LDC license available, else WNUT-17 or Few-NERD.\n    priority: P0\n    gpu_budget_hours: 10\n    deps: []\n    dataset: WNUT-17 or Few-NERD (public, no license required)\n    model: qwen3-8b (new fine-tune)\n    note: User confirmed no LDC license — use public datasets only\n\n  - id: exp-004\n    name: re_diagnostic_analysis\n    claim: 2\n    description: >\n      Per-relation-type consistency breakdown on existing pilot_004/005 data.\n      Analyze error propagation patterns: which relation types have highest/lowest\n      SJ correlation, and how does this relate to type frequency and structural complexity.\n      Include bootstrap confidence intervals for all rho comparisons (SJ vs FK).\n    priority: P0\n    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n    deps: []\n    note: CPU-only analysis on existing data. Bootstrap CI for rho differences.\n\n  - id: exp-005\n    name: temperature_sensitivity_analysis\n    claim: 2\n    description: >\n      Systematic comparison of T=0.7 vs T=1.0 on both NER and RE.\n      Analyze signal-noise tradeoff: T=0.7 reduces diversity (oracle headroom)\n      but improves signal quality (conditional rho). Data already exists\n      from pilot_004 (T=1.0) and pilot_005 (T=0.7).\n    priority: P0\n    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n    deps: []\n    note: CPU-only analysis on existing data\n\n  # === P1: Important, strongly recommended ===\n\n  - id: exp-006\n    name: adaptive_compute_demo\n    claim: 1\n    description: >\n      Demonstrate concrete TTS improvement on NER: compare F1 of\n      SJ-based best-of-N selection vs FK-based vs random vs greedy.\n      Show that SJ-guided selection outperforms alternatives.\n      This is the \"practical impact\" evidence — without it, headline result has no F1 number.\n    priority: P0\n    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n    deps: [exp-001]\n    note: CPU-only, uses N=16 samples from exp-001. Upgraded from P1 per Reviewer feedback.\n\n  - id: exp-007\n    name: ner_multi_model\n    claim: 1\n    description: >\n      NER pilot with a different model family (LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct)\n      on SciERC to show the effect is model-agnostic. Main Conference\n      reviewers will almost certainly ask about single-model limitation.\n    priority: P0\n    gpu_budget_hours: 15\n    deps: []\n    dataset: SciERC\n    model: llama-3.1-8b (new fine-tune)\n    note: Upgraded from P1 per Reviewer feedback — R2 is a near-certain reviewer question.\n\n  - id: exp-008\n    name: re_n16_confirmation\n    claim: 2\n    description: >\n      RE N=16 on SciERC to confirm negative finding with higher statistical power.\n      Also tests whether N=16 changes the SJ vs FK comparison on RE.\n    priority: P1\n    gpu_budget_hours: 12\n    deps: []\n    dataset: SciERC\n    model: ft_002_v2\n\n  - id: exp-009\n    name: capability_stratification\n    claim: 2\n    description: >\n      Stratify instances by difficulty (greedy F1 buckets) for both NER and RE.\n      Analyze how rho varies across difficulty strata — does the\n      capability-dependent pattern hold across subtasks?\n    priority: P1\n    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n    deps: [exp-001]\n    note: CPU-only analysis\n\n  # === P2: Nice-to-have ===\n\n  - id: exp-010\n    name: selection_curves\n    claim: 1\n    description: >\n      Best-of-N selection curves for N=1,2,4,8,16 comparing SJ vs FK vs random\n      on NER. Visualize how F1 scales with compute budget under different\n      confidence signals.\n    priority: P2\n    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n    deps: [exp-001]\n    note: CPU-only visualization\n\n  - id: exp-011\n    name: ner_ood_robustness\n    claim: 1\n    description: >\n      Test NER consistency signal on out-of-distribution instances\n      (e.g., different domains within OntoNotes, or cross-domain transfer).\n    priority: P2\n    gpu_budget_hours: 5\n    deps: [exp-003]\n\n# GPU Budget Summary (updated):\n# P0: 51 GPU-hours (exp-001: 18h [3 seeds], exp-002: 8h, exp-003: 10h, exp-004/005/006: 0h, exp-007: 15h)\n# P1: 12 GPU-hours (exp-008: 12h, exp-009: 0h)\n# P2: 5 GPU-hours (exp-010: 0h, exp-011: 5h)\n# Total P0: 51 GPU-hours\n# Available: 8x RTX 5090 = ~192 GPU-hours/day → P0 completable in ~1 day with parallel execution\n","numLines":154,"startLine":1,"totalLines":154}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01VmoByzJXyufLSBSjtfsjoT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have all the context I need. Let me construct the worst-tier predictions for each experiment. Let me think through each one carefully based on the worst-tier definition and the existing data.\n\nKey existing baselines from completed experiments:\n- NER on SciERC (pilot_004, N=8, T=1.0, ft_002_v2): rho_sj=0.3825, rho_fk=0.2590, greedy_f1=0.6671, oracle_f1=0.7756, headroom=0.1085\n- NER on SciERC (pilot_003, N=8, T=1.0, ft_001): rho_sj=0.3808, rho_fk=0.3362\n\n\n- RE on SciERC (pilot_004): rho_sj=0.2441, rho_fk=0.2782, cond_rho_sj=0.3161\n- E1 component analysis shows head_sj rho at 0.210 with all components performing weakly\n\nLooking at the worst-tier parameters, I'm seeing that scaling to N=16 doesn't improve NER performance and may even regress it, while cross-dataset SJ signal remains quite weak across the board.\n\nThe SJ advantage over FK disappears in cross-dataset settings, adaptive compute yields minimal practical gains, and even conditional RE rho stays stuck in the 0.2-0.3 range with limited oracle headroom. This is pointing me toward reframing the narrative as a negative-result paper exploring why self-consistency fails as a confidence signal for structured prediction tasks.\n\nFor the N=16 experiment specifically, I'm hypothesizing that additional samples introduce noise rather than signal, which would explain why we're not seeing the expected improvement in correlation metrics. than averaging it out. With N=8 we got rho_sj~0.38. With N=16, if the extra 8 samples are noisy (model occasionally produces very different parses), the SJ estimate gets noisier rather than more stable. rho stays in 0.33-0.39.\n\nOracle headroom with N=16 would increase slightly (more samples = higher oracle), but the rho doesn't improve, meaning the signal quality doesn't improve with more samples. This undermines the \"test-time scaling\" narrative because more compute doesn't yield better selection signal.\n\n**exp-002: ner_conll2003**\nCoNLL-2003 only has 4 entity types versus SciERC's 6, so FK might perform comparably to SJ since surface agreement becomes sufficient in a simpler output space. The SJ-FK delta could drop below 3 percentage points or FK might even outperform SJ. The model might be more calibrated on cleaner CoNLL annotations, reducing variance across samples and making consistency less discriminative. Alternatively, the model could struggle with the CoNLL format specifically, producing more uniform but poor performance.\n\n**exp-003: ner_dataset3 (WNUT-17 or Few-NERD)**\nWNUT-17's noisy social media data could cause the model to produce highly inconsistent outputs, weakening the SJ signal dramatically. Or with Few-NERD's fine-grained entity types, the task becomes too difficult and most instances have such low F1 that consistency stops being a useful signal.\n\n**exp-004: re_diagnostic_analysis**\nNow examining what happens when I break down performance by relation type. pattern — all relation types have similarly poor SJ correlation. This means we can't even identify a subset of relations where SJ works well, undermining the \"boundary condition\" narrative.\n\n**exp-005: temperature_sensitivity_analysis**\nWorst case: T=0.7 doesn't improve signal quality significantly over T=1.0. The tradeoff is flat — lower temperature reduces diversity but doesn't proportionally improve signal quality. This undermines the claim that temperature is a controllable dial for the signal-noise tradeoff.\n\nIn worst case, this becomes a core experiment for the negative result paper, showing that even with temperature tuning the signal remains weak.\n\n**exp-006: adaptive_compute_demo**\nWorst case: SJ-based selection barely outperforms random. F1 gain < 1.5pp, not statistically significant. This kills the practical application angle entirely.\n\n**exp-007: ner_multi_model**\nLLaMA could behave quite differently — SJ might not outperform FK, suggesting the effect is model-specific rather than generalizable.\n\n**exp-008: re_n16_confirmation**\nWith N=16, the negative finding holds firm: RE rho_sj stays below 0.30 even when conditioning on other factors, confirming the weak signal with high statistical power.\n\n**exp-009: capability_stratification**\nThe capability-dependent pattern might not emerge cleanly — without a clear monotonic relationship between difficulty and correlation strength, the \"within-capability\" argument loses its force.\n\n**exp-010: selection_curves**\nFlat curves would indicate that adding more samples doesn't help because the underlying signal isn't improving, leaving SJ barely distinguishable from random selection.\n\n**exp-011: ner_ood_robustness**\nChecking how OOD performance...","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7145,"cache_read_input_tokens":27331,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7145},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8fc9b383-c417-43bc-b48d-b0a1903064d9","uuid":"408a8a36-df82-4268-9e91-d1941e4d582a"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01VmoByzJXyufLSBSjtfsjoT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 全部废弃。不能再 claim \"SJ is better than FK for IE\"。转为 negative-result-driven\n  analytical paper——\"Why Self-Consistency Fails as a Confidence Signal for Structured Prediction\"。\n  新 storyline：(1) 系统性地测试了 consistency-based confidence 在 IE 上的表现，\n  (2) 发现即使 SJ 在单数据集上优于 FK，该优势不跨数据集迁移，\n  (3) 通过 error decomposition 和 dataset characteristic analysis 解释失败原因\n  （entity type granularity、annotation noise、output space complexity），\n  (4) 给出 practitioner guideline：什么条件下 consistency signal 可能有效。\n  exp-009 (capability stratification) 和 exp-005 (temperature sensitivity) 从 supporting 升级为 core experiments。\n  仍然是 EMNLP-caliber contribution，但需要大幅增加 analysis depth 来补偿缺失的 positive result。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: ner_n16_scierc\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      NER N=16 on SciERC (ft_002_v2)。测试增加采样数是否能将 rho 推过 0.40。\n      3 seeds (42, 123, 456) 用于 rho 稳定性检验。\n    expected_results:\n      ner_rho_sj_full_seed42: 0.371\n      ner_rho_sj_full_seed123: 0.354\n      ner_rho_sj_full_seed456: 0.362\n      ner_rho_sj_full_mean: 0.362\n      ner_rho_sj_full_std: 0.009\n      ner_rho_fk_full_mean: 0.278\n      ner_rho_sj_cond_mean: 0.358\n      ner_rho_fk_cond_mean: 0.264\n      ner_greedy_f1: 0.667\n      ner_oracle_f1_n16: 0.742\n      ner_oracle_headroom_n16: 0.075\n      ner_oracle_headroom_n8_baseline: 0.109\n      ner_sj_beats_fk: true\n      ner_rho_delta_n16_minus_n8: -0.014\n      ner_sample_f1_pct_zero: 11.5\n      p_sj_full: 2.8e-17\n    result_rationale: >\n      N=16 未能提升 rho 反而轻微下降（0.383→0.362）。机制：ft_002_v2 在 SciERC 上\n      greedy F1=0.667，模型 confidence 已较高，额外 8 个 sample 引入的不是\n      \"uncertainty-driven variation\" 而是 \"sampling noise\"——在 T=1.0 下，低概率\n      token 被采到的机会增加，产生偶发性的 spurious outputs（如漏标一个 entity 或\n      hallucinate 一个不存在的 entity type），这些 outlier 拉低了 SJ 均值但不对应\n      真实的 accuracy 差异。oracle headroom 从 10.9pp 降至 7.5pp 也证实了这点：\n      N=16 的额外样本并未发现更好的输出，反而稀释了 N=8 中已经存在的好样本的权重。\n      跨 seed 的 std=0.009 说明这不是随机波动而是系统性 pattern。SJ 仍然 beat FK\n      （因为 FK 也同步下降），但 delta 缩小，两者都在 0.35-0.37 的 plateau。\n      这直接否定了 \"more samples → better signal\" 的 test-time scaling 核心假设。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: N-scaling effect on NER rho (SciERC, ft_002_v2)\"\n        columns: [N, rho_sj_full, rho_fk_full, sj_minus_fk, oracle_headroom, pct_zero_f1]\n        rows:\n          - [8, 0.383, 0.259, \"+0.124\", \"10.9pp\", \"12.2%\"]\n          - [16, 0.362, 0.278, \"+0.084\", \"7.5pp\", \"11.5%\"]\n          - [\"delta\", \"-0.021\", \"+0.019\", \"-0.040\", \"-3.4pp\", \"-0.7pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-seed rho stability (N=16)\"\n        columns: [seed, rho_sj_full, rho_fk_full, rho_sj_cond]\n        rows:\n          - [42, 0.371, 0.282, 0.365]\n          - [123, 0.354, 0.270, 0.348]\n          - [456, 0.362, 0.281, 0.361]\n          - [mean±std, \"0.362±0.009\", \"0.278±0.007\", \"0.358±0.009\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: rho vs N 折线图 (N=1,2,4,8,16)。SJ 和 FK 两条线在 N=8 处 peak 后 plateau/下降，shaded area 表示 3-seed CI。\"\n      - \"Fig: oracle headroom vs N 递减曲线，表明额外 samples 未找到更好输出。\"\n    analysis: >\n      N=16 不仅未提升 rho，反而使 SJ 信号略有退化。这是 worst case 的核心打击：\n      如果 more samples 不能 improve signal quality，那么 test-time scaling 的\n      compute-accuracy tradeoff 就不成立。在 negative result paper 中，这成为\n      Section 4.1 的关键发现——\"Sampling beyond saturation: diminishing returns\n      in consistency estimation\"。需要用 per-instance analysis 展示 N=16 的额外\n      samples 主要在 high-confidence instances 上引入 noise（这些 instance 本来\n      N=8 已经给出一致的好预测），而在 low-confidence instances 上也没有帮助\n      （因为 model 根本不具备该 instance 的知识，更多 sample 只是更多 wrong answers）。\n\n  - name: ner_conll2003\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      Fine-tune Qwen3-8B on CoNLL-2003 (LoRA) + NER pilot (N=8, T=0.7)。\n      验证 Claim 1 的跨数据集泛化。\n    expected_results:\n      ft_ner_f1_greedy: 0.812\n      ft_re_f1_greedy: null\n      ner_rho_sj_full: 0.22\n      ner_rho_fk_full: 0.24\n      ner_rho_sj_cond: 0.25\n      ner_rho_fk_cond: 0.27\n      ner_sj_beats_fk_full: false\n      ner_sj_beats_fk_cond: false\n      sj_minus_fk_delta_full: -0.02\n      ner_oracle_f1: 0.856\n      ner_oracle_headroom: 0.044\n      ner_sample_f1_pct_zero: 4.2\n      ner_greedy_f1: 0.812\n      p_sj_full: 3.1e-04\n    result_rationale: >\n      CoNLL-2003 只有 4 种 entity type (PER, ORG, LOC, MISC)，输出空间远小于\n      SciERC (6 types: Method, Task, Material, Metric, OtherScientificTerm, Generic)。\n      在简单输出空间下，FK 的 \"flat token agreement\" 足以捕获一致性信息，SJ 的\n      \"structural similarity\" 优势消失。具体来说：(1) CoNLL 的 entity boundary\n      更清晰（新闻文本 vs 科学论文），模型 greedy F1 高达 0.812，sample 间变异\n      极小（pct_zero=4.2%），consistency 几乎是 ceiling，rho 被 range restriction\n      压低；(2) 4-type 系统中，两个 sample 如果识别了同一个 span 但 type 不同，\n      只有 4 种可能——FK 的 exact match 在这个低基数下和 SJ 的 soft match 没有\n      区别差异；(3) CoNLL 的标注质量远高于 SciERC（IAA > 0.95 vs SciERC ~0.80），\n      annotation noise 更低意味着 model uncertainty 更少地反映在 consistency 上。\n      FK 反超 SJ 2pp 虽小但一致。这证明 SJ 优势是 dataset-specific artifact。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-dataset NER comparison (N=8)\"\n        columns: [dataset, n_types, rho_sj, rho_fk, sj_minus_fk, greedy_f1, oracle_headroom]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC, 6, 0.383, 0.259, \"+0.124\", 0.667, \"10.9pp\"]\n          - [CoNLL-2003, 4, 0.220, 0.240, \"-0.020\", 0.812, \"4.4pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: SJ vs FK rho 的 dataset-by-dataset 对比 bar chart，error bar 来自 bootstrap。SciERC 上 SJ >> FK，CoNLL 上 FK ≥ SJ。\"\n      - \"Fig: scatter plot of per-instance SJ vs F1 on CoNLL，point cloud 高度聚集在右上角（high SJ, high F1），几乎无 discriminative power。\"\n    analysis: >\n      CoNLL-2003 的失败有两层含义：(1) rho 本身低（0.22）说明 consistency signal\n      在高准确率 regime 下 discriminative power 不足——当 greedy 已经 0.81 时，\n      几乎所有 instance 都 high-consistency-high-accuracy，没有 variation 来建立\n      correlation；(2) SJ < FK 说明 structural metric 在简单输出空间下没有优势。\n      这不是 model quality issue（greedy F1 更高），而是 consistency-as-confidence\n      在 \"easy dataset\" 上的根本限制。在 negative result paper 中归为\n      \"the performance ceiling effect\"——当 base model 足够好时，consistency\n      无法区分 \"slightly uncertain\" 和 \"very confident\"。\n\n  - name: ner_dataset3\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      Fine-tune Qwen3-8B on WNUT-17 (LoRA) + NER pilot (N=8, T=0.7)。\n      第三个数据集验证跨数据集泛化。\n    expected_results:\n      ft_ner_f1_greedy: 0.418\n      ner_rho_sj_full: 0.19\n      ner_rho_fk_full: 0.15\n      ner_rho_sj_cond: 0.26\n      ner_rho_fk_cond: 0.20\n      ner_sj_beats_fk_full: true\n      sj_minus_fk_delta_full: 0.04\n      ner_oracle_f1: 0.522\n      ner_oracle_headroom: 0.104\n      ner_sample_f1_pct_zero: 38.7\n      ner_all_zero_filtered: 89\n      n_test: 1287\n      p_sj_full: 7.4e-03\n    result_rationale: >\n      WNUT-17 是 noisy social media NER（tweets, Reddit），标注质量低，entity\n      mentions 高度非规范（缩写、slang、hashtag 中的 entity）。Qwen3-8B fine-tune\n      on WNUT 的 greedy F1 仅 0.418——模型在这种 domain 上 struggle。两个问题\n      叠加导致 rho 极低：(1) 高 pct_zero (38.7%) 表示大量 instance 模型完全\n      无法处理，consistency 对这些 instance 无信号（全部 output 都是 wrong，但\n      \"consistently wrong\" 的 SJ 仍可能较高——classic false-confidence 问题）；\n      (2) annotation noise——WNUT 的 IAA 远低于 CoNLL/SciERC，部分 gold annotation\n      本身有争议，模型的 \"inconsistency\" 可能反映的是标注模糊而非模型不确定性。\n      SJ 仍微弱地 beat FK (delta=0.04pp)，但 rho=0.19 说明 consistency 几乎不是\n      一个 useful confidence signal。这和 CoNLL 的失败模式相反但殊途同归：\n      CoNLL 太简单导致 ceiling effect，WNUT 太难导致 floor effect。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Three-dataset NER comparison\"\n        columns: [dataset, domain, n_types, greedy_f1, rho_sj, rho_fk, sj_minus_fk, headroom]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC, scientific, 6, 0.667, 0.383, 0.259, \"+0.124\", \"10.9pp\"]\n          - [CoNLL-2003, news, 4, 0.812, 0.220, 0.240, \"-0.020\", \"4.4pp\"]\n          - [WNUT-17, social-media, 6, 0.418, 0.190, 0.150, \"+0.040\", \"10.4pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 三数据集 rho 对比图，x轴=greedy F1，y轴=rho_sj。呈倒U形：SciERC 在 sweet spot (F1~0.67)，CoNLL 太高，WNUT 太低。\"\n      - \"Fig: pct_zero vs rho scatter，展示 zero-F1 率和 rho 的负相关。\"\n    analysis: >\n      三数据集结果呈现清晰的 inverted-U pattern：consistency signal 只在 model\n      performance 的 \"中间地带\" 有效。太高（CoNLL, F1=0.81）→ ceiling，太低\n      （WNUT, F1=0.42）→ floor。SciERC (F1=0.67) 恰好在 sweet spot。\n      这是 negative result paper 最有价值的发现之一——consistency-based confidence\n      有一个 narrow operating range，依赖于 base model 在特定 dataset 上的 performance\n      level。对 practitioner 的 guideline：先评估 greedy performance，如果 F1 < 0.50\n      或 F1 > 0.80，consistency signal 可能不可靠。\n\n  - name: re_diagnostic_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-004\n    description: >\n      Per-relation-type consistency breakdown on existing pilot_004/005 data。\n      分析哪些 relation type 的 SJ correlation 最高/最低。\n    expected_results:\n      used_by_rho_sj: 0.28\n      feature_of_rho_sj: 0.21\n      part_of_rho_sj: 0.19\n      evaluate_for_rho_sj: 0.16\n      hyponym_of_rho_sj: 0.14\n      conjunction_rho_sj: 0.11\n      compare_rho_sj: 0.09\n      overall_re_rho_sj: 0.244\n      rho_vs_freq_spearman: 0.41\n      rho_vs_freq_p: 0.15\n      rho_range: \"[0.09, 0.28]\"\n      bootstrap_ci_95_sj_minus_fk: \"[-0.08, 0.05]\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Per-relation-type 分析显示所有 type 的 rho 都很低（0.09-0.28），没有任何\n      type 接近 NER-level 的 0.38。频率最高的 Used-for (~40% of instances) rho\n      最高但也只有 0.28，这主要是因为 sample size 给了更稳定的估计而非信号本身更强。\n      低频 type (Compare, Conjunction 各 <20 instances) 的 rho 极不稳定。\n      rho 和 type frequency 的 Spearman correlation r=0.41 但 p=0.15（N=7 types\n      太少，无法达到显著）。关键发现：即使是 \"最简单\" 的 relation type (Used-for,\n      双向 entity pair + 一个 type label)，SJ rho 也远低于 NER 的 span-only task。\n      这证实 E1 的诊断：问题不在特定 relation type 而在 relational prediction 的\n      compound structure 本身。Bootstrap CI for SJ-FK delta 跨零（[-0.08, 0.05]），\n      说明 SJ 在 RE 上是否优于 FK 连统计显著性都无法确立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-relation-type SJ rho\"\n        columns: [relation_type, n_instances, rho_sj, rho_fk, sj_minus_fk]\n        rows:\n          - [Used-for, 156, 0.28, 0.26, \"+0.02\"]\n          - [Feature-of, 72, 0.21, 0.24, \"-0.03\"]\n          - [Part-of, 58, 0.19, 0.22, \"-0.03\"]\n          - [Evaluate-for, 43, 0.16, 0.18, \"-0.02\"]\n          - [Hyponym-of, 34, 0.14, 0.19, \"-0.05\"]\n          - [Conjunction, 21, 0.11, 0.08, \"+0.03\"]\n          - [Compare, 13, 0.09, 0.12, \"-0.03\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: per-relation-type rho bar chart (SJ vs FK)，按 frequency 降序排列。所有 bar 都 < 0.30，SJ 和 FK 交替领先。\"\n      - \"Fig: rho vs relation frequency scatter + regression line，呈弱正相关但不显著。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这个分析对 negative result paper 至关重要——它提供了 \"mechanistic explanation\"\n      而非仅仅说 \"RE doesn't work\"。所有 relation type 均匀地差，排除了\n      \"特定 hard relation type 拉低平均\" 的解释。这与 E1 的 component-wise\n      analysis 一致：问题是 structural 的，不是 type-specific 的。\n      在论文中，这成为 Section 5.2 \"Error propagation is type-agnostic\"。\n\n  - name: temperature_sensitivity_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      T=0.7 vs T=1.0 系统性对比，分析 signal-noise tradeoff。\n      升级为 core experiment。\n    expected_results:\n      ner_rho_sj_t07: 0.376\n      ner_rho_sj_t10: 0.383\n      ner_rho_fk_t07: 0.268\n      ner_rho_fk_t10: 0.259\n      ner_oracle_headroom_t07: 0.072\n      ner_oracle_headroom_t10: 0.109\n      ner_pct_zero_t07: 9.8\n      ner_pct_zero_t10: 12.2\n      ner_all_zero_count_t07: 28\n      ner_all_zero_count_t10: 21\n      re_rho_sj_t07: 0.25\n      re_rho_sj_t10: 0.244\n      re_cond_rho_sj_t07: 0.28\n      re_cond_rho_sj_t10: 0.316\n      re_oracle_headroom_t07: 0.112\n      re_oracle_headroom_t10: 0.167\n      re_pct_zero_t07: 41.2\n      re_pct_zero_t10: 44.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      T=0.7 的效果是 mixed 而非 clearly beneficial：NER 上 rho 基本不变（0.383→0.376），\n      oracle headroom 显著下降（10.9pp→7.2pp），意味着 T=0.7 压缩了 output diversity\n      但没有提升 signal quality。SJ rho 微降是因为 T=0.7 使 samples 更 homogeneous，\n      reduced variance 同时 reduce 了 correlation 的 statistical power。FK 略升\n      （T=0.7 下 token-level agreement 更高，FK 的 range 扩大）。\n      RE 上更 tricky：full rho 微升（0.244→0.25）但 conditional rho 反降\n      （0.316→0.28）。机制：T=0.7 增加了 all-zero instances（28 vs 21 for NER;\n      对 RE 从 84 增到 ~95），这些被 filter 后 conditional set 变小且 composition\n      变了——剩下的 \"conditional\" instances 在 T=0.7 下更 homogeneous，反而\n      降低了 SJ 的 discriminative power。\n      总体：temperature 不是一个有效的调节 knob。在 negative result paper 中\n      这是关键 Section——\"Temperature tuning cannot rescue weak consistency signals\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Temperature sensitivity (NER + RE)\"\n        columns: [task, metric, \"T=0.7\", \"T=1.0\", delta]\n        rows:\n          - [NER, rho_sj_full, 0.376, 0.383, \"-0.007\"]\n          - [NER, rho_fk_full, 0.268, 0.259, \"+0.009\"]\n          - [NER, oracle_headroom, \"7.2pp\", \"10.9pp\", \"-3.7pp\"]\n          - [NER, pct_zero, \"9.8%\", \"12.2%\", \"-2.4pp\"]\n          - [RE, rho_sj_full, 0.250, 0.244, \"+0.006\"]\n          - [RE, rho_sj_cond, 0.280, 0.316, \"-0.036\"]\n          - [RE, oracle_headroom, \"11.2pp\", \"16.7pp\", \"-5.5pp\"]\n          - [RE, pct_zero, \"41.2%\", \"44.3%\", \"-3.1pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 2x2 panel (NER/RE × rho/headroom)，T=0.7 vs T=1.0 comparison。所有 panel 都显示 tradeoff 是 flat-to-negative。\"\n      - \"Fig: signal-noise tradeoff curve：x=oracle headroom (diversity proxy), y=rho_sj。理想曲线应 upward-sloping（更多 diversity → worse signal），但实际是 flat，说明 diversity reduction 没有 proportional signal gain。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Temperature analysis 在 worst case 下成为 core finding：consistency-based\n      confidence 不仅在 cross-dataset 上 fragile，连最基本的 hyperparameter tuning\n      都无法系统性 improve 它。这给 practitioner 的 takeaway 是：不要指望通过调\n      temperature 来 \"fix\" 弱 consistency signal。在论文中这支持 Section 4.3\n      \"The signal-noise tradeoff is not tunable\" 的论点。\n\n  - name: adaptive_compute_demo\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      NER best-of-N selection：SJ vs FK vs random vs greedy。\n      使用 exp-001 的 N=16 数据。\n    expected_results:\n      f1_greedy: 0.667\n      f1_random_bon16: 0.681\n      f1_fk_bon16: 0.684\n      f1_sj_bon16: 0.679\n      f1_oracle_bon16: 0.742\n      sj_gain_over_greedy: 1.2\n      sj_gain_over_random: -0.2\n      fk_gain_over_random: 0.3\n      sj_vs_random_p_value: 0.47\n      sj_vs_fk_p_value: 0.62\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 worst case 下 N=16 的 rho 只有 0.362，这意味着 SJ ranking 和 true F1\n      ranking 的 agreement 不足以实现有效 selection。具体：rho=0.36 对应\n      ~13% 的 ranking variance explained (R²≈0.13)，也就是说 87% 的 selection\n      decision 基本是 noise。SJ-based selection 仅获得 +1.2pp over greedy，\n      而 random selection 也能获得 +1.4pp（因为 best-of-N 本身有 order statistics\n      的 upward bias——即使 random 选，N=16 中的 maximum 期望也高于 mean）。\n      SJ selection (0.679) 甚至不如 random (0.681) 和 FK (0.684)。FK 微弱领先\n      是因为 N=16 下 FK 的 rho 反而比 N=8 时略升（0.259→0.278），且 FK 作为\n      discrete metric 在 selection 的 tie-breaking 上有优势。\n      Bootstrap test 显示 SJ vs random 的差异不显著 (p=0.47)。\n      这彻底否定了 \"SJ enables practical test-time scaling\" 的 claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Adaptive compute results (NER, SciERC, N=16)\"\n        columns: [method, F1, gain_over_greedy, gain_over_random, p_vs_random]\n        rows:\n          - [greedy, 0.667, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [random-best-of-16, 0.681, \"+1.4pp\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [FK-best-of-16, 0.684, \"+1.7pp\", \"+0.3pp\", 0.58]\n          - [SJ-best-of-16, 0.679, \"+1.2pp\", \"-0.2pp\", 0.47]\n          - [oracle-best-of-16, 0.742, \"+7.5pp\", \"+6.1pp\", \"<1e-10\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: bar chart of F1 by selection method。SJ、FK、random 三者几乎无差异，都远低于 oracle，表明 headroom exists but signals can't exploit it。\"\n      - \"Fig: selection efficiency curve：(F1_method - F1_greedy) / (F1_oracle - F1_greedy) 作为 'signal efficiency'。SJ=16%, FK=23%, random=19%。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Adaptive compute 的失败是 worst case 最 damaging 的结果——它直接否定了论文\n      的 practical motivation。即使 oracle headroom 有 7.5pp（说明 N=16 中确实\n      存在更好的输出），SJ 和 FK 都无法有效识别它们。在 negative result paper 中\n      这支持核心论点：\"consistency ≠ confidence for structured prediction\"。\n      实际 headroom 的存在 vs 无法利用 形成鲜明对比，成为 Figure 1 的素材。\n\n  - name: ner_multi_model\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct fine-tune on SciERC + NER pilot (N=8, T=0.7)。\n      测试 model-agnostic 假设。\n    expected_results:\n      ft_ner_f1_greedy: 0.591\n      ner_rho_sj_full: 0.28\n      ner_rho_fk_full: 0.31\n      ner_rho_sj_cond: 0.31\n      ner_rho_fk_cond: 0.33\n      ner_sj_beats_fk_full: false\n      sj_minus_fk_delta: -0.03\n      ner_oracle_f1: 0.718\n      ner_oracle_headroom: 0.127\n      ner_sample_f1_pct_zero: 22.6\n      parse_failures_stochastic: 12\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLaMA-3.1-8B 在 SciERC NER 上 fine-tune 后 greedy F1=0.591，低于\n      Qwen3-8B 的 0.667。更重要的是，LLaMA 的 sampling behavior 不同于 Qwen：\n      (1) LLaMA 在 structured output generation 上更 prone to format variation\n      （偶发 parse failure=12，Qwen 的 ft_002_v2 是 0），这些 format inconsistency\n      被 SJ 错误地解读为 \"low confidence\" 但实际上是 generation style 差异；\n      (2) LLaMA 的 logit distribution 在 entity boundary 上更 diffuse（Qwen3 有\n      更好的 instruction following），导致 sample 间的 entity span 变异更多是\n      \"boundary wobble\" 而非 \"genuine uncertainty\"。FK 反而 beat SJ 因为\n      FK 的 binary agreement 对 boundary 偏移不敏感（只看 token overlap），\n      而 SJ 的 soft matching 被 boundary 偏移 confound。\n      这表明 SJ 的效果不仅 dataset-specific 还 model-specific——只在\n      Qwen3-8B + SciERC 的特定组合下有效。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Model comparison on SciERC NER (N=8)\"\n        columns: [model, greedy_f1, rho_sj, rho_fk, sj_minus_fk, parse_fail]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen3-8B, 0.667, 0.383, 0.259, \"+0.124\", 0]\n          - [LLaMA-3.1-8B, 0.591, 0.280, 0.310, \"-0.030\", 12]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 两个 model 的 per-instance SJ vs F1 scatter plot 对比。Qwen 有清晰的 positive trend，LLaMA 的 cloud 更 diffuse 且有一簇 low-SJ-but-high-F1 points（boundary wobble 导致）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Multi-model 的失败为 negative result paper 增加了一个重要维度：\n      SJ 的效果取决于 model 的 sampling behavior（output format stability、\n      boundary precision）。这不是 consistency-as-confidence 的固有属性，\n      而是特定 model 的 artifact。在论文中归为 Section 5.3 \"Model-specific\n      confounds in consistency estimation\"——boundary wobble 和 format variation\n      是 SJ metric 无法区分的 noise sources。\n\n  - name: re_n16_confirmation\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      RE N=16 on SciERC，确认 RE negative finding with higher statistical power。\n    expected_results:\n      re_rho_sj_full: 0.231\n      re_rho_fk_full: 0.268\n      re_rho_sj_cond: 0.27\n      re_rho_fk_cond: 0.29\n      re_sj_beats_fk_full: false\n      re_sj_beats_fk_cond: false\n      re_greedy_f1: 0.421\n      re_oracle_f1_n16: 0.558\n      re_oracle_headroom_n16: 0.137\n      re_sample_f1_pct_zero: 42.8\n      re_all_zero_filtered: 92\n      sj_minus_fk_delta_full: -0.037\n      bootstrap_ci_95_rho_sj: \"[0.18, 0.28]\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      RE 在 N=16 下 rho 甚至轻微下降（0.244→0.231），与 NER 的 pattern 一致。\n      机制相同：额外 samples 增加 noise，relational output 的 compound structure\n      使 noise 更严重——每个 relation triplet 有 3 个可独立出错的 component\n      (head, tail, type)，N=16 下 spurious triplet 的组合爆炸更剧烈。\n      Conditional rho 也下降到 0.27（从 0.316），因为 T=1.0 下 N=16 的 all-zero\n      filter 更激进（92 instances removed），剩余 conditional set 更 homogeneous。\n      Bootstrap CI [0.18, 0.28] 确认 rho_sj < 0.30 with high confidence。\n      SJ 在 full 和 conditional set 上均输给 FK，进一步证实 RE 上 structural\n      metric 没有优势。这为 negative result paper 提供了 \"confirmed with\n      adequate statistical power\" 的论证。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: RE N-scaling (SciERC)\"\n        columns: [N, rho_sj_full, rho_fk_full, rho_sj_cond, rho_fk_cond, headroom]\n        rows:\n          - [8, 0.244, 0.278, 0.316, 0.307, \"16.7pp\"]\n          - [16, 0.231, 0.268, 0.270, 0.290, \"13.7pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: RE rho 的 bootstrap distribution histogram (N=16)，虚线标注 0.30 threshold，>95% 的 distribution 在 0.30 以下。\"\n    analysis: >\n      N=16 confirmation 使 RE negative result 从 \"suggestive\" 变为 \"definitive\"。\n      Combined with E1 component analysis and exp-004 per-type analysis，\n      构成三重证据链证明 consistency-based confidence 在 RE 上 fundamentally 失败。\n\n  - name: capability_stratification\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      按 greedy F1 分层（buckets）分析 rho 在不同 difficulty strata 的变化。\n      升级为 core experiment。\n    expected_results:\n      ner_strata:\n        f1_0_to_0.2_rho_sj: 0.08\n        f1_0.2_to_0.4_rho_sj: 0.14\n        f1_0.4_to_0.6_rho_sj: 0.22\n        f1_0.6_to_0.8_rho_sj: 0.31\n        f1_0.8_to_1.0_rho_sj: 0.12\n      re_strata:\n        f1_0_to_0.2_rho_sj: 0.05\n        f1_0.2_to_0.4_rho_sj: 0.11\n        f1_0.4_to_0.6_rho_sj: 0.18\n        f1_0.6_to_0.8_rho_sj: 0.15\n        f1_0.8_to_1.0_rho_sj: 0.07\n      ner_monotonic_test_p: 0.12\n      re_monotonic_test_p: 0.38\n    result_rationale: >\n      Stratification 显示 rho 的 difficulty-dependent pattern 存在但不 clean：\n      (1) NER 上大致呈倒 U 形——极低 F1 (<0.2) 和极高 F1 (>0.8) strata 的 rho\n      都很低，中间 strata 最高 (0.31 at 0.6-0.8)。低端低是因为 model\n      consistently fails（no signal），高端低是因为 consistently succeeds\n      （ceiling effect），和 exp-002/003 的 cross-dataset pattern 一致。\n      但 Jonckheere-Terpstra monotonic trend test p=0.12 不显著，不能 claim\n      \"rho increases with model capability\"。(2) RE 上 pattern 更 noisy，\n      最高的 stratum (0.4-0.6) 也只有 rho=0.18，monotonic test p=0.38\n      完全不显著。\n      关键问题：每个 stratum 的 n 很小（50-120 instances），statistical power\n      不足以在单个 stratum 内建立 reliable rho 估计。这使得 \"capability-dependent\n      signal\" 的论点 suggestive 而非 conclusive。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: rho_sj by difficulty stratum\"\n        columns: [stratum, ner_n, ner_rho_sj, re_n, re_rho_sj]\n        rows:\n          - [\"[0, 0.2)\", 68, 0.08, 157, 0.05]\n          - [\"[0.2, 0.4)\", 72, 0.14, 83, 0.11]\n          - [\"[0.4, 0.6)\", 89, 0.22, 62, 0.18]\n          - [\"[0.6, 0.8)\", 118, 0.31, 55, 0.15]\n          - [\"[0.8, 1.0]\", 182, 0.12, 40, 0.07]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: line plot of rho_sj vs difficulty stratum for NER and RE。NER 呈 inverted-U，RE 是 flat-with-noise。Error bars (bootstrap) 大且 overlapping。\"\n      - \"Fig: heatmap of n_instances × stratum × task，highlighting the small-n problem in high strata。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Stratification 在 worst case 下提供了 nuanced 但 inconclusive 的结果。\n      Inverted-U pattern 和 cross-dataset 的 inverted-U 一致（都是 difficulty-driven），\n      但单数据集内的 statistical power 不足。在 negative result paper 中，这仍然\n      有价值：它定性地指出 consistency signal 有一个 \"Goldilocks zone\"\n      (not too easy, not too hard)，但无法精确定义这个 zone 的边界。\n      这成为 Section 6 \"Towards a theory of consistency effectiveness\" 的\n      speculative-but-grounded 讨论。\n\n  - name: selection_curves\n    plan_id: exp-010\n    description: >\n      Best-of-N selection curves for N=1,2,4,8,16，SJ vs FK vs random on NER。\n    expected_results:\n      f1_at_n1: 0.667\n      f1_sj_at_n2: 0.670\n      f1_sj_at_n4: 0.674\n      f1_sj_at_n8: 0.677\n      f1_sj_at_n16: 0.679\n      f1_random_at_n2: 0.671\n      f1_random_at_n4: 0.675\n      f1_random_at_n8: 0.679\n      f1_random_at_n16: 0.681\n      f1_oracle_at_n2: 0.698\n      f1_oracle_at_n4: 0.719\n      f1_oracle_at_n8: 0.742\n      f1_oracle_at_n16: 0.742\n    result_rationale: >\n      Selection curves 展示了 devastating 的 pattern：SJ-based selection curve\n      始终在 random selection curve 之下或与之重叠。Oracle curve 持续上升直到\n      N=8（N=16 时 plateau），说明更好的输出 exist in the sample set，但 SJ\n      无法识别它们。具体：(1) N=2 时 SJ 和 random 几乎相同（0.670 vs 0.671），\n      因为只有两个选择，rho=0.36 的 pairwise accuracy 只有 ~60%，和 random 50%\n      的差距太小；(2) 随着 N 增加，random 的 order-statistics boost 反而比\n      SJ 的 selection accuracy improvement 更大——random-best-of-N 有\n      closed-form 的 expected maximum 增长，而 SJ-based selection 受限于 rho<0.40\n      的 poor ranking quality。\n      这是 negative result paper 的 key visualization——一张图就能传达\n      \"consistency signal doesn't enable test-time scaling\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Selection curves (NER, SciERC)\"\n        columns: [N, oracle, SJ, FK, random]\n        rows:\n          - [1, 0.667, 0.667, 0.667, 0.667]\n          - [2, 0.698, 0.670, 0.671, 0.671]\n          - [4, 0.719, 0.674, 0.676, 0.675]\n          - [8, 0.742, 0.677, 0.680, 0.679]\n          - [16, 0.742, 0.679, 0.684, 0.681]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Selection curves (F1 vs N)。Oracle 快速上升，SJ/FK/random 三条线 bunched together 缓慢上升。Shaded area between oracle and methods = 'unrealized potential'。这是 paper Figure 1 candidate。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Selection curves 是 worst case 下最直观的 visualization。它将 abstract\n      的 \"rho is low\" 翻译成 concrete 的 \"you can't improve F1\"。\n      Oracle-method gap 随 N 扩大（N=16 时 oracle=0.742 vs SJ=0.679, gap=6.3pp），\n      说明 headroom exists but is unexploitable。\n\n  - name: ner_ood_robustness\n    plan_id: exp-011\n    description: >\n      Cross-domain transfer test for NER consistency signal。\n      用 WNUT-17 fine-tuned model 在 unseen domain 上测试。\n    expected_results:\n      ner_rho_sj_ood: 0.12\n      ner_rho_fk_ood: 0.14\n      ner_greedy_f1_ood: 0.295\n      ner_oracle_f1_ood: 0.408\n      ner_oracle_headroom_ood: 0.113\n      ner_sample_f1_pct_zero_ood: 52.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      OOD 下 model performance 剧烈下降（greedy F1=0.295），超过一半 instances\n      F1=0。这是 exp-003 (WNUT) 的 floor effect 的极端版本。consistency signal\n      在 OOD 下完全崩溃 (rho=0.12)，因为模型对 OOD instances 的 sampling behavior\n      是 \"randomly wrong in different ways\"——每个 sample 犯不同的错误，high\n      consistency 不 correlate with accuracy。这和 in-domain 的 \"consistently\n      wrong\" pattern 不同：OOD 下甚至 consistency 本身都不稳定。\n      Oracle headroom 11.3pp 存在但完全 unexploitable。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: In-distribution vs OOD NER comparison\"\n        columns: [condition, greedy_f1, rho_sj, rho_fk, pct_zero, headroom]\n        rows:\n          - [in-domain, 0.418, 0.190, 0.150, \"38.7%\", \"10.4pp\"]\n          - [OOD, 0.295, 0.120, 0.140, \"52.3%\", \"11.3pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: in-domain vs OOD rho comparison bar chart，两者都 << 0.30，OOD 更差。\"\n    analysis: >\n      OOD 结果是 negative result paper 的 final nail：consistency signal 不仅\n      不跨数据集迁移（exp-002/003），不跨模型迁移（exp-007），在 domain shift\n      下更是 completely fails。这为 practitioner guideline 增加了第三条限制：\n      \"do not use consistency-based confidence on out-of-distribution data\"。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7145,"cache_read_input_tokens":27331,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7145},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8fc9b383-c417-43bc-b48d-b0a1903064d9","uuid":"fe990cb5-12b9-452f-8a12-bff4833dec7f"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":334718,"duration_api_ms":335755,"num_turns":3,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 全部废弃。不能再 claim \"SJ is better than FK for IE\"。转为 negative-result-driven\n  analytical paper——\"Why Self-Consistency Fails as a Confidence Signal for Structured Prediction\"。\n  新 storyline：(1) 系统性地测试了 consistency-based confidence 在 IE 上的表现，\n  (2) 发现即使 SJ 在单数据集上优于 FK，该优势不跨数据集迁移，\n  (3) 通过 error decomposition 和 dataset characteristic analysis 解释失败原因\n  （entity type granularity、annotation noise、output space complexity），\n  (4) 给出 practitioner guideline：什么条件下 consistency signal 可能有效。\n  exp-009 (capability stratification) 和 exp-005 (temperature sensitivity) 从 supporting 升级为 core experiments。\n  仍然是 EMNLP-caliber contribution，但需要大幅增加 analysis depth 来补偿缺失的 positive result。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: ner_n16_scierc\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      NER N=16 on SciERC (ft_002_v2)。测试增加采样数是否能将 rho 推过 0.40。\n      3 seeds (42, 123, 456) 用于 rho 稳定性检验。\n    expected_results:\n      ner_rho_sj_full_seed42: 0.371\n      ner_rho_sj_full_seed123: 0.354\n      ner_rho_sj_full_seed456: 0.362\n      ner_rho_sj_full_mean: 0.362\n      ner_rho_sj_full_std: 0.009\n      ner_rho_fk_full_mean: 0.278\n      ner_rho_sj_cond_mean: 0.358\n      ner_rho_fk_cond_mean: 0.264\n      ner_greedy_f1: 0.667\n      ner_oracle_f1_n16: 0.742\n      ner_oracle_headroom_n16: 0.075\n      ner_oracle_headroom_n8_baseline: 0.109\n      ner_sj_beats_fk: true\n      ner_rho_delta_n16_minus_n8: -0.014\n      ner_sample_f1_pct_zero: 11.5\n      p_sj_full: 2.8e-17\n    result_rationale: >\n      N=16 未能提升 rho 反而轻微下降（0.383→0.362）。机制：ft_002_v2 在 SciERC 上\n      greedy F1=0.667，模型 confidence 已较高，额外 8 个 sample 引入的不是\n      \"uncertainty-driven variation\" 而是 \"sampling noise\"——在 T=1.0 下，低概率\n      token 被采到的机会增加，产生偶发性的 spurious outputs（如漏标一个 entity 或\n      hallucinate 一个不存在的 entity type），这些 outlier 拉低了 SJ 均值但不对应\n      真实的 accuracy 差异。oracle headroom 从 10.9pp 降至 7.5pp 也证实了这点：\n      N=16 的额外样本并未发现更好的输出，反而稀释了 N=8 中已经存在的好样本的权重。\n      跨 seed 的 std=0.009 说明这不是随机波动而是系统性 pattern。SJ 仍然 beat FK\n      （因为 FK 也同步下降），但 delta 缩小，两者都在 0.35-0.37 的 plateau。\n      这直接否定了 \"more samples → better signal\" 的 test-time scaling 核心假设。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: N-scaling effect on NER rho (SciERC, ft_002_v2)\"\n        columns: [N, rho_sj_full, rho_fk_full, sj_minus_fk, oracle_headroom, pct_zero_f1]\n        rows:\n          - [8, 0.383, 0.259, \"+0.124\", \"10.9pp\", \"12.2%\"]\n          - [16, 0.362, 0.278, \"+0.084\", \"7.5pp\", \"11.5%\"]\n          - [\"delta\", \"-0.021\", \"+0.019\", \"-0.040\", \"-3.4pp\", \"-0.7pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-seed rho stability (N=16)\"\n        columns: [seed, rho_sj_full, rho_fk_full, rho_sj_cond]\n        rows:\n          - [42, 0.371, 0.282, 0.365]\n          - [123, 0.354, 0.270, 0.348]\n          - [456, 0.362, 0.281, 0.361]\n          - [mean±std, \"0.362±0.009\", \"0.278±0.007\", \"0.358±0.009\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: rho vs N 折线图 (N=1,2,4,8,16)。SJ 和 FK 两条线在 N=8 处 peak 后 plateau/下降，shaded area 表示 3-seed CI。\"\n      - \"Fig: oracle headroom vs N 递减曲线，表明额外 samples 未找到更好输出。\"\n    analysis: >\n      N=16 不仅未提升 rho，反而使 SJ 信号略有退化。这是 worst case 的核心打击：\n      如果 more samples 不能 improve signal quality，那么 test-time scaling 的\n      compute-accuracy tradeoff 就不成立。在 negative result paper 中，这成为\n      Section 4.1 的关键发现——\"Sampling beyond saturation: diminishing returns\n      in consistency estimation\"。需要用 per-instance analysis 展示 N=16 的额外\n      samples 主要在 high-confidence instances 上引入 noise（这些 instance 本来\n      N=8 已经给出一致的好预测），而在 low-confidence instances 上也没有帮助\n      （因为 model 根本不具备该 instance 的知识，更多 sample 只是更多 wrong answers）。\n\n  - name: ner_conll2003\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      Fine-tune Qwen3-8B on CoNLL-2003 (LoRA) + NER pilot (N=8, T=0.7)。\n      验证 Claim 1 的跨数据集泛化。\n    expected_results:\n      ft_ner_f1_greedy: 0.812\n      ft_re_f1_greedy: null\n      ner_rho_sj_full: 0.22\n      ner_rho_fk_full: 0.24\n      ner_rho_sj_cond: 0.25\n      ner_rho_fk_cond: 0.27\n      ner_sj_beats_fk_full: false\n      ner_sj_beats_fk_cond: false\n      sj_minus_fk_delta_full: -0.02\n      ner_oracle_f1: 0.856\n      ner_oracle_headroom: 0.044\n      ner_sample_f1_pct_zero: 4.2\n      ner_greedy_f1: 0.812\n      p_sj_full: 3.1e-04\n    result_rationale: >\n      CoNLL-2003 只有 4 种 entity type (PER, ORG, LOC, MISC)，输出空间远小于\n      SciERC (6 types: Method, Task, Material, Metric, OtherScientificTerm, Generic)。\n      在简单输出空间下，FK 的 \"flat token agreement\" 足以捕获一致性信息，SJ 的\n      \"structural similarity\" 优势消失。具体来说：(1) CoNLL 的 entity boundary\n      更清晰（新闻文本 vs 科学论文），模型 greedy F1 高达 0.812，sample 间变异\n      极小（pct_zero=4.2%），consistency 几乎是 ceiling，rho 被 range restriction\n      压低；(2) 4-type 系统中，两个 sample 如果识别了同一个 span 但 type 不同，\n      只有 4 种可能——FK 的 exact match 在这个低基数下和 SJ 的 soft match 没有\n      区别差异；(3) CoNLL 的标注质量远高于 SciERC（IAA > 0.95 vs SciERC ~0.80），\n      annotation noise 更低意味着 model uncertainty 更少地反映在 consistency 上。\n      FK 反超 SJ 2pp 虽小但一致。这证明 SJ 优势是 dataset-specific artifact。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-dataset NER comparison (N=8)\"\n        columns: [dataset, n_types, rho_sj, rho_fk, sj_minus_fk, greedy_f1, oracle_headroom]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC, 6, 0.383, 0.259, \"+0.124\", 0.667, \"10.9pp\"]\n          - [CoNLL-2003, 4, 0.220, 0.240, \"-0.020\", 0.812, \"4.4pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: SJ vs FK rho 的 dataset-by-dataset 对比 bar chart，error bar 来自 bootstrap。SciERC 上 SJ >> FK，CoNLL 上 FK ≥ SJ。\"\n      - \"Fig: scatter plot of per-instance SJ vs F1 on CoNLL，point cloud 高度聚集在右上角（high SJ, high F1），几乎无 discriminative power。\"\n    analysis: >\n      CoNLL-2003 的失败有两层含义：(1) rho 本身低（0.22）说明 consistency signal\n      在高准确率 regime 下 discriminative power 不足——当 greedy 已经 0.81 时，\n      几乎所有 instance 都 high-consistency-high-accuracy，没有 variation 来建立\n      correlation；(2) SJ < FK 说明 structural metric 在简单输出空间下没有优势。\n      这不是 model quality issue（greedy F1 更高），而是 consistency-as-confidence\n      在 \"easy dataset\" 上的根本限制。在 negative result paper 中归为\n      \"the performance ceiling effect\"——当 base model 足够好时，consistency\n      无法区分 \"slightly uncertain\" 和 \"very confident\"。\n\n  - name: ner_dataset3\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      Fine-tune Qwen3-8B on WNUT-17 (LoRA) + NER pilot (N=8, T=0.7)。\n      第三个数据集验证跨数据集泛化。\n    expected_results:\n      ft_ner_f1_greedy: 0.418\n      ner_rho_sj_full: 0.19\n      ner_rho_fk_full: 0.15\n      ner_rho_sj_cond: 0.26\n      ner_rho_fk_cond: 0.20\n      ner_sj_beats_fk_full: true\n      sj_minus_fk_delta_full: 0.04\n      ner_oracle_f1: 0.522\n      ner_oracle_headroom: 0.104\n      ner_sample_f1_pct_zero: 38.7\n      ner_all_zero_filtered: 89\n      n_test: 1287\n      p_sj_full: 7.4e-03\n    result_rationale: >\n      WNUT-17 是 noisy social media NER（tweets, Reddit），标注质量低，entity\n      mentions 高度非规范（缩写、slang、hashtag 中的 entity）。Qwen3-8B fine-tune\n      on WNUT 的 greedy F1 仅 0.418——模型在这种 domain 上 struggle。两个问题\n      叠加导致 rho 极低：(1) 高 pct_zero (38.7%) 表示大量 instance 模型完全\n      无法处理，consistency 对这些 instance 无信号（全部 output 都是 wrong，但\n      \"consistently wrong\" 的 SJ 仍可能较高——classic false-confidence 问题）；\n      (2) annotation noise——WNUT 的 IAA 远低于 CoNLL/SciERC，部分 gold annotation\n      本身有争议，模型的 \"inconsistency\" 可能反映的是标注模糊而非模型不确定性。\n      SJ 仍微弱地 beat FK (delta=0.04pp)，但 rho=0.19 说明 consistency 几乎不是\n      一个 useful confidence signal。这和 CoNLL 的失败模式相反但殊途同归：\n      CoNLL 太简单导致 ceiling effect，WNUT 太难导致 floor effect。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Three-dataset NER comparison\"\n        columns: [dataset, domain, n_types, greedy_f1, rho_sj, rho_fk, sj_minus_fk, headroom]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC, scientific, 6, 0.667, 0.383, 0.259, \"+0.124\", \"10.9pp\"]\n          - [CoNLL-2003, news, 4, 0.812, 0.220, 0.240, \"-0.020\", \"4.4pp\"]\n          - [WNUT-17, social-media, 6, 0.418, 0.190, 0.150, \"+0.040\", \"10.4pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 三数据集 rho 对比图，x轴=greedy F1，y轴=rho_sj。呈倒U形：SciERC 在 sweet spot (F1~0.67)，CoNLL 太高，WNUT 太低。\"\n      - \"Fig: pct_zero vs rho scatter，展示 zero-F1 率和 rho 的负相关。\"\n    analysis: >\n      三数据集结果呈现清晰的 inverted-U pattern：consistency signal 只在 model\n      performance 的 \"中间地带\" 有效。太高（CoNLL, F1=0.81）→ ceiling，太低\n      （WNUT, F1=0.42）→ floor。SciERC (F1=0.67) 恰好在 sweet spot。\n      这是 negative result paper 最有价值的发现之一——consistency-based confidence\n      有一个 narrow operating range，依赖于 base model 在特定 dataset 上的 performance\n      level。对 practitioner 的 guideline：先评估 greedy performance，如果 F1 < 0.50\n      或 F1 > 0.80，consistency signal 可能不可靠。\n\n  - name: re_diagnostic_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-004\n    description: >\n      Per-relation-type consistency breakdown on existing pilot_004/005 data。\n      分析哪些 relation type 的 SJ correlation 最高/最低。\n    expected_results:\n      used_by_rho_sj: 0.28\n      feature_of_rho_sj: 0.21\n      part_of_rho_sj: 0.19\n      evaluate_for_rho_sj: 0.16\n      hyponym_of_rho_sj: 0.14\n      conjunction_rho_sj: 0.11\n      compare_rho_sj: 0.09\n      overall_re_rho_sj: 0.244\n      rho_vs_freq_spearman: 0.41\n      rho_vs_freq_p: 0.15\n      rho_range: \"[0.09, 0.28]\"\n      bootstrap_ci_95_sj_minus_fk: \"[-0.08, 0.05]\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Per-relation-type 分析显示所有 type 的 rho 都很低（0.09-0.28），没有任何\n      type 接近 NER-level 的 0.38。频率最高的 Used-for (~40% of instances) rho\n      最高但也只有 0.28，这主要是因为 sample size 给了更稳定的估计而非信号本身更强。\n      低频 type (Compare, Conjunction 各 <20 instances) 的 rho 极不稳定。\n      rho 和 type frequency 的 Spearman correlation r=0.41 但 p=0.15（N=7 types\n      太少，无法达到显著）。关键发现：即使是 \"最简单\" 的 relation type (Used-for,\n      双向 entity pair + 一个 type label)，SJ rho 也远低于 NER 的 span-only task。\n      这证实 E1 的诊断：问题不在特定 relation type 而在 relational prediction 的\n      compound structure 本身。Bootstrap CI for SJ-FK delta 跨零（[-0.08, 0.05]），\n      说明 SJ 在 RE 上是否优于 FK 连统计显著性都无法确立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-relation-type SJ rho\"\n        columns: [relation_type, n_instances, rho_sj, rho_fk, sj_minus_fk]\n        rows:\n          - [Used-for, 156, 0.28, 0.26, \"+0.02\"]\n          - [Feature-of, 72, 0.21, 0.24, \"-0.03\"]\n          - [Part-of, 58, 0.19, 0.22, \"-0.03\"]\n          - [Evaluate-for, 43, 0.16, 0.18, \"-0.02\"]\n          - [Hyponym-of, 34, 0.14, 0.19, \"-0.05\"]\n          - [Conjunction, 21, 0.11, 0.08, \"+0.03\"]\n          - [Compare, 13, 0.09, 0.12, \"-0.03\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: per-relation-type rho bar chart (SJ vs FK)，按 frequency 降序排列。所有 bar 都 < 0.30，SJ 和 FK 交替领先。\"\n      - \"Fig: rho vs relation frequency scatter + regression line，呈弱正相关但不显著。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这个分析对 negative result paper 至关重要——它提供了 \"mechanistic explanation\"\n      而非仅仅说 \"RE doesn't work\"。所有 relation type 均匀地差，排除了\n      \"特定 hard relation type 拉低平均\" 的解释。这与 E1 的 component-wise\n      analysis 一致：问题是 structural 的，不是 type-specific 的。\n      在论文中，这成为 Section 5.2 \"Error propagation is type-agnostic\"。\n\n  - name: temperature_sensitivity_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      T=0.7 vs T=1.0 系统性对比，分析 signal-noise tradeoff。\n      升级为 core experiment。\n    expected_results:\n      ner_rho_sj_t07: 0.376\n      ner_rho_sj_t10: 0.383\n      ner_rho_fk_t07: 0.268\n      ner_rho_fk_t10: 0.259\n      ner_oracle_headroom_t07: 0.072\n      ner_oracle_headroom_t10: 0.109\n      ner_pct_zero_t07: 9.8\n      ner_pct_zero_t10: 12.2\n      ner_all_zero_count_t07: 28\n      ner_all_zero_count_t10: 21\n      re_rho_sj_t07: 0.25\n      re_rho_sj_t10: 0.244\n      re_cond_rho_sj_t07: 0.28\n      re_cond_rho_sj_t10: 0.316\n      re_oracle_headroom_t07: 0.112\n      re_oracle_headroom_t10: 0.167\n      re_pct_zero_t07: 41.2\n      re_pct_zero_t10: 44.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      T=0.7 的效果是 mixed 而非 clearly beneficial：NER 上 rho 基本不变（0.383→0.376），\n      oracle headroom 显著下降（10.9pp→7.2pp），意味着 T=0.7 压缩了 output diversity\n      但没有提升 signal quality。SJ rho 微降是因为 T=0.7 使 samples 更 homogeneous，\n      reduced variance 同时 reduce 了 correlation 的 statistical power。FK 略升\n      （T=0.7 下 token-level agreement 更高，FK 的 range 扩大）。\n      RE 上更 tricky：full rho 微升（0.244→0.25）但 conditional rho 反降\n      （0.316→0.28）。机制：T=0.7 增加了 all-zero instances（28 vs 21 for NER;\n      对 RE 从 84 增到 ~95），这些被 filter 后 conditional set 变小且 composition\n      变了——剩下的 \"conditional\" instances 在 T=0.7 下更 homogeneous，反而\n      降低了 SJ 的 discriminative power。\n      总体：temperature 不是一个有效的调节 knob。在 negative result paper 中\n      这是关键 Section——\"Temperature tuning cannot rescue weak consistency signals\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Temperature sensitivity (NER + RE)\"\n        columns: [task, metric, \"T=0.7\", \"T=1.0\", delta]\n        rows:\n          - [NER, rho_sj_full, 0.376, 0.383, \"-0.007\"]\n          - [NER, rho_fk_full, 0.268, 0.259, \"+0.009\"]\n          - [NER, oracle_headroom, \"7.2pp\", \"10.9pp\", \"-3.7pp\"]\n          - [NER, pct_zero, \"9.8%\", \"12.2%\", \"-2.4pp\"]\n          - [RE, rho_sj_full, 0.250, 0.244, \"+0.006\"]\n          - [RE, rho_sj_cond, 0.280, 0.316, \"-0.036\"]\n          - [RE, oracle_headroom, \"11.2pp\", \"16.7pp\", \"-5.5pp\"]\n          - [RE, pct_zero, \"41.2%\", \"44.3%\", \"-3.1pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 2x2 panel (NER/RE × rho/headroom)，T=0.7 vs T=1.0 comparison。所有 panel 都显示 tradeoff 是 flat-to-negative。\"\n      - \"Fig: signal-noise tradeoff curve：x=oracle headroom (diversity proxy), y=rho_sj。理想曲线应 upward-sloping（更多 diversity → worse signal），但实际是 flat，说明 diversity reduction 没有 proportional signal gain。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Temperature analysis 在 worst case 下成为 core finding：consistency-based\n      confidence 不仅在 cross-dataset 上 fragile，连最基本的 hyperparameter tuning\n      都无法系统性 improve 它。这给 practitioner 的 takeaway 是：不要指望通过调\n      temperature 来 \"fix\" 弱 consistency signal。在论文中这支持 Section 4.3\n      \"The signal-noise tradeoff is not tunable\" 的论点。\n\n  - name: adaptive_compute_demo\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      NER best-of-N selection：SJ vs FK vs random vs greedy。\n      使用 exp-001 的 N=16 数据。\n    expected_results:\n      f1_greedy: 0.667\n      f1_random_bon16: 0.681\n      f1_fk_bon16: 0.684\n      f1_sj_bon16: 0.679\n      f1_oracle_bon16: 0.742\n      sj_gain_over_greedy: 1.2\n      sj_gain_over_random: -0.2\n      fk_gain_over_random: 0.3\n      sj_vs_random_p_value: 0.47\n      sj_vs_fk_p_value: 0.62\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 worst case 下 N=16 的 rho 只有 0.362，这意味着 SJ ranking 和 true F1\n      ranking 的 agreement 不足以实现有效 selection。具体：rho=0.36 对应\n      ~13% 的 ranking variance explained (R²≈0.13)，也就是说 87% 的 selection\n      decision 基本是 noise。SJ-based selection 仅获得 +1.2pp over greedy，\n      而 random selection 也能获得 +1.4pp（因为 best-of-N 本身有 order statistics\n      的 upward bias——即使 random 选，N=16 中的 maximum 期望也高于 mean）。\n      SJ selection (0.679) 甚至不如 random (0.681) 和 FK (0.684)。FK 微弱领先\n      是因为 N=16 下 FK 的 rho 反而比 N=8 时略升（0.259→0.278），且 FK 作为\n      discrete metric 在 selection 的 tie-breaking 上有优势。\n      Bootstrap test 显示 SJ vs random 的差异不显著 (p=0.47)。\n      这彻底否定了 \"SJ enables practical test-time scaling\" 的 claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Adaptive compute results (NER, SciERC, N=16)\"\n        columns: [method, F1, gain_over_greedy, gain_over_random, p_vs_random]\n        rows:\n          - [greedy, 0.667, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [random-best-of-16, 0.681, \"+1.4pp\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [FK-best-of-16, 0.684, \"+1.7pp\", \"+0.3pp\", 0.58]\n          - [SJ-best-of-16, 0.679, \"+1.2pp\", \"-0.2pp\", 0.47]\n          - [oracle-best-of-16, 0.742, \"+7.5pp\", \"+6.1pp\", \"<1e-10\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: bar chart of F1 by selection method。SJ、FK、random 三者几乎无差异，都远低于 oracle，表明 headroom exists but signals can't exploit it。\"\n      - \"Fig: selection efficiency curve：(F1_method - F1_greedy) / (F1_oracle - F1_greedy) 作为 'signal efficiency'。SJ=16%, FK=23%, random=19%。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Adaptive compute 的失败是 worst case 最 damaging 的结果——它直接否定了论文\n      的 practical motivation。即使 oracle headroom 有 7.5pp（说明 N=16 中确实\n      存在更好的输出），SJ 和 FK 都无法有效识别它们。在 negative result paper 中\n      这支持核心论点：\"consistency ≠ confidence for structured prediction\"。\n      实际 headroom 的存在 vs 无法利用 形成鲜明对比，成为 Figure 1 的素材。\n\n  - name: ner_multi_model\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct fine-tune on SciERC + NER pilot (N=8, T=0.7)。\n      测试 model-agnostic 假设。\n    expected_results:\n      ft_ner_f1_greedy: 0.591\n      ner_rho_sj_full: 0.28\n      ner_rho_fk_full: 0.31\n      ner_rho_sj_cond: 0.31\n      ner_rho_fk_cond: 0.33\n      ner_sj_beats_fk_full: false\n      sj_minus_fk_delta: -0.03\n      ner_oracle_f1: 0.718\n      ner_oracle_headroom: 0.127\n      ner_sample_f1_pct_zero: 22.6\n      parse_failures_stochastic: 12\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLaMA-3.1-8B 在 SciERC NER 上 fine-tune 后 greedy F1=0.591，低于\n      Qwen3-8B 的 0.667。更重要的是，LLaMA 的 sampling behavior 不同于 Qwen：\n      (1) LLaMA 在 structured output generation 上更 prone to format variation\n      （偶发 parse failure=12，Qwen 的 ft_002_v2 是 0），这些 format inconsistency\n      被 SJ 错误地解读为 \"low confidence\" 但实际上是 generation style 差异；\n      (2) LLaMA 的 logit distribution 在 entity boundary 上更 diffuse（Qwen3 有\n      更好的 instruction following），导致 sample 间的 entity span 变异更多是\n      \"boundary wobble\" 而非 \"genuine uncertainty\"。FK 反而 beat SJ 因为\n      FK 的 binary agreement 对 boundary 偏移不敏感（只看 token overlap），\n      而 SJ 的 soft matching 被 boundary 偏移 confound。\n      这表明 SJ 的效果不仅 dataset-specific 还 model-specific——只在\n      Qwen3-8B + SciERC 的特定组合下有效。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Model comparison on SciERC NER (N=8)\"\n        columns: [model, greedy_f1, rho_sj, rho_fk, sj_minus_fk, parse_fail]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen3-8B, 0.667, 0.383, 0.259, \"+0.124\", 0]\n          - [LLaMA-3.1-8B, 0.591, 0.280, 0.310, \"-0.030\", 12]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 两个 model 的 per-instance SJ vs F1 scatter plot 对比。Qwen 有清晰的 positive trend，LLaMA 的 cloud 更 diffuse 且有一簇 low-SJ-but-high-F1 points（boundary wobble 导致）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Multi-model 的失败为 negative result paper 增加了一个重要维度：\n      SJ 的效果取决于 model 的 sampling behavior（output format stability、\n      boundary precision）。这不是 consistency-as-confidence 的固有属性，\n      而是特定 model 的 artifact。在论文中归为 Section 5.3 \"Model-specific\n      confounds in consistency estimation\"——boundary wobble 和 format variation\n      是 SJ metric 无法区分的 noise sources。\n\n  - name: re_n16_confirmation\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      RE N=16 on SciERC，确认 RE negative finding with higher statistical power。\n    expected_results:\n      re_rho_sj_full: 0.231\n      re_rho_fk_full: 0.268\n      re_rho_sj_cond: 0.27\n      re_rho_fk_cond: 0.29\n      re_sj_beats_fk_full: false\n      re_sj_beats_fk_cond: false\n      re_greedy_f1: 0.421\n      re_oracle_f1_n16: 0.558\n      re_oracle_headroom_n16: 0.137\n      re_sample_f1_pct_zero: 42.8\n      re_all_zero_filtered: 92\n      sj_minus_fk_delta_full: -0.037\n      bootstrap_ci_95_rho_sj: \"[0.18, 0.28]\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      RE 在 N=16 下 rho 甚至轻微下降（0.244→0.231），与 NER 的 pattern 一致。\n      机制相同：额外 samples 增加 noise，relational output 的 compound structure\n      使 noise 更严重——每个 relation triplet 有 3 个可独立出错的 component\n      (head, tail, type)，N=16 下 spurious triplet 的组合爆炸更剧烈。\n      Conditional rho 也下降到 0.27（从 0.316），因为 T=1.0 下 N=16 的 all-zero\n      filter 更激进（92 instances removed），剩余 conditional set 更 homogeneous。\n      Bootstrap CI [0.18, 0.28] 确认 rho_sj < 0.30 with high confidence。\n      SJ 在 full 和 conditional set 上均输给 FK，进一步证实 RE 上 structural\n      metric 没有优势。这为 negative result paper 提供了 \"confirmed with\n      adequate statistical power\" 的论证。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: RE N-scaling (SciERC)\"\n        columns: [N, rho_sj_full, rho_fk_full, rho_sj_cond, rho_fk_cond, headroom]\n        rows:\n          - [8, 0.244, 0.278, 0.316, 0.307, \"16.7pp\"]\n          - [16, 0.231, 0.268, 0.270, 0.290, \"13.7pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: RE rho 的 bootstrap distribution histogram (N=16)，虚线标注 0.30 threshold，>95% 的 distribution 在 0.30 以下。\"\n    analysis: >\n      N=16 confirmation 使 RE negative result 从 \"suggestive\" 变为 \"definitive\"。\n      Combined with E1 component analysis and exp-004 per-type analysis，\n      构成三重证据链证明 consistency-based confidence 在 RE 上 fundamentally 失败。\n\n  - name: capability_stratification\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      按 greedy F1 分层（buckets）分析 rho 在不同 difficulty strata 的变化。\n      升级为 core experiment。\n    expected_results:\n      ner_strata:\n        f1_0_to_0.2_rho_sj: 0.08\n        f1_0.2_to_0.4_rho_sj: 0.14\n        f1_0.4_to_0.6_rho_sj: 0.22\n        f1_0.6_to_0.8_rho_sj: 0.31\n        f1_0.8_to_1.0_rho_sj: 0.12\n      re_strata:\n        f1_0_to_0.2_rho_sj: 0.05\n        f1_0.2_to_0.4_rho_sj: 0.11\n        f1_0.4_to_0.6_rho_sj: 0.18\n        f1_0.6_to_0.8_rho_sj: 0.15\n        f1_0.8_to_1.0_rho_sj: 0.07\n      ner_monotonic_test_p: 0.12\n      re_monotonic_test_p: 0.38\n    result_rationale: >\n      Stratification 显示 rho 的 difficulty-dependent pattern 存在但不 clean：\n      (1) NER 上大致呈倒 U 形——极低 F1 (<0.2) 和极高 F1 (>0.8) strata 的 rho\n      都很低，中间 strata 最高 (0.31 at 0.6-0.8)。低端低是因为 model\n      consistently fails（no signal），高端低是因为 consistently succeeds\n      （ceiling effect），和 exp-002/003 的 cross-dataset pattern 一致。\n      但 Jonckheere-Terpstra monotonic trend test p=0.12 不显著，不能 claim\n      \"rho increases with model capability\"。(2) RE 上 pattern 更 noisy，\n      最高的 stratum (0.4-0.6) 也只有 rho=0.18，monotonic test p=0.38\n      完全不显著。\n      关键问题：每个 stratum 的 n 很小（50-120 instances），statistical power\n      不足以在单个 stratum 内建立 reliable rho 估计。这使得 \"capability-dependent\n      signal\" 的论点 suggestive 而非 conclusive。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: rho_sj by difficulty stratum\"\n        columns: [stratum, ner_n, ner_rho_sj, re_n, re_rho_sj]\n        rows:\n          - [\"[0, 0.2)\", 68, 0.08, 157, 0.05]\n          - [\"[0.2, 0.4)\", 72, 0.14, 83, 0.11]\n          - [\"[0.4, 0.6)\", 89, 0.22, 62, 0.18]\n          - [\"[0.6, 0.8)\", 118, 0.31, 55, 0.15]\n          - [\"[0.8, 1.0]\", 182, 0.12, 40, 0.07]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: line plot of rho_sj vs difficulty stratum for NER and RE。NER 呈 inverted-U，RE 是 flat-with-noise。Error bars (bootstrap) 大且 overlapping。\"\n      - \"Fig: heatmap of n_instances × stratum × task，highlighting the small-n problem in high strata。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Stratification 在 worst case 下提供了 nuanced 但 inconclusive 的结果。\n      Inverted-U pattern 和 cross-dataset 的 inverted-U 一致（都是 difficulty-driven），\n      但单数据集内的 statistical power 不足。在 negative result paper 中，这仍然\n      有价值：它定性地指出 consistency signal 有一个 \"Goldilocks zone\"\n      (not too easy, not too hard)，但无法精确定义这个 zone 的边界。\n      这成为 Section 6 \"Towards a theory of consistency effectiveness\" 的\n      speculative-but-grounded 讨论。\n\n  - name: selection_curves\n    plan_id: exp-010\n    description: >\n      Best-of-N selection curves for N=1,2,4,8,16，SJ vs FK vs random on NER。\n    expected_results:\n      f1_at_n1: 0.667\n      f1_sj_at_n2: 0.670\n      f1_sj_at_n4: 0.674\n      f1_sj_at_n8: 0.677\n      f1_sj_at_n16: 0.679\n      f1_random_at_n2: 0.671\n      f1_random_at_n4: 0.675\n      f1_random_at_n8: 0.679\n      f1_random_at_n16: 0.681\n      f1_oracle_at_n2: 0.698\n      f1_oracle_at_n4: 0.719\n      f1_oracle_at_n8: 0.742\n      f1_oracle_at_n16: 0.742\n    result_rationale: >\n      Selection curves 展示了 devastating 的 pattern：SJ-based selection curve\n      始终在 random selection curve 之下或与之重叠。Oracle curve 持续上升直到\n      N=8（N=16 时 plateau），说明更好的输出 exist in the sample set，但 SJ\n      无法识别它们。具体：(1) N=2 时 SJ 和 random 几乎相同（0.670 vs 0.671），\n      因为只有两个选择，rho=0.36 的 pairwise accuracy 只有 ~60%，和 random 50%\n      的差距太小；(2) 随着 N 增加，random 的 order-statistics boost 反而比\n      SJ 的 selection accuracy improvement 更大——random-best-of-N 有\n      closed-form 的 expected maximum 增长，而 SJ-based selection 受限于 rho<0.40\n      的 poor ranking quality。\n      这是 negative result paper 的 key visualization——一张图就能传达\n      \"consistency signal doesn't enable test-time scaling\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Selection curves (NER, SciERC)\"\n        columns: [N, oracle, SJ, FK, random]\n        rows:\n          - [1, 0.667, 0.667, 0.667, 0.667]\n          - [2, 0.698, 0.670, 0.671, 0.671]\n          - [4, 0.719, 0.674, 0.676, 0.675]\n          - [8, 0.742, 0.677, 0.680, 0.679]\n          - [16, 0.742, 0.679, 0.684, 0.681]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Selection curves (F1 vs N)。Oracle 快速上升，SJ/FK/random 三条线 bunched together 缓慢上升。Shaded area between oracle and methods = 'unrealized potential'。这是 paper Figure 1 candidate。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Selection curves 是 worst case 下最直观的 visualization。它将 abstract\n      的 \"rho is low\" 翻译成 concrete 的 \"you can't improve F1\"。\n      Oracle-method gap 随 N 扩大（N=16 时 oracle=0.742 vs SJ=0.679, gap=6.3pp），\n      说明 headroom exists but is unexploitable。\n\n  - name: ner_ood_robustness\n    plan_id: exp-011\n    description: >\n      Cross-domain transfer test for NER consistency signal。\n      用 WNUT-17 fine-tuned model 在 unseen domain 上测试。\n    expected_results:\n      ner_rho_sj_ood: 0.12\n      ner_rho_fk_ood: 0.14\n      ner_greedy_f1_ood: 0.295\n      ner_oracle_f1_ood: 0.408\n      ner_oracle_headroom_ood: 0.113\n      ner_sample_f1_pct_zero_ood: 52.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      OOD 下 model performance 剧烈下降（greedy F1=0.295），超过一半 instances\n      F1=0。这是 exp-003 (WNUT) 的 floor effect 的极端版本。consistency signal\n      在 OOD 下完全崩溃 (rho=0.12)，因为模型对 OOD instances 的 sampling behavior\n      是 \"randomly wrong in different ways\"——每个 sample 犯不同的错误，high\n      consistency 不 correlate with accuracy。这和 in-domain 的 \"consistently\n      wrong\" pattern 不同：OOD 下甚至 consistency 本身都不稳定。\n      Oracle headroom 11.3pp 存在但完全 unexploitable。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: In-distribution vs OOD NER comparison\"\n        columns: [condition, greedy_f1, rho_sj, rho_fk, pct_zero, headroom]\n        rows:\n          - [in-domain, 0.418, 0.190, 0.150, \"38.7%\", \"10.4pp\"]\n          - [OOD, 0.295, 0.120, 0.140, \"52.3%\", \"11.3pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: in-domain vs OOD rho comparison bar chart，两者都 << 0.30，OOD 更差。\"\n    analysis: >\n      OOD 结果是 negative result paper 的 final nail：consistency signal 不仅\n      不跨数据集迁移（exp-002/003），不跨模型迁移（exp-007），在 domain shift\n      下更是 completely fails。这为 practitioner guideline 增加了第三条限制：\n      \"do not use consistency-based confidence on out-of-distribution data\"。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"8fc9b383-c417-43bc-b48d-b0a1903064d9","total_cost_usd":0.6916334500000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22635,"cache_read_input_tokens":63272,"output_tokens":14125,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22635,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":13783,"cache_read_input_tokens":27331,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7145,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7145},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":7297,"outputTokens":5264,"cacheReadInputTokens":509167,"cacheCreationInputTokens":64680,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.1653837,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":4,"outputTokens":14125,"cacheReadInputTokens":63272,"cacheCreationInputTokens":22635,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.52624975,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"b3a822dd-2617-4fcd-be22-9813dd3dbbf3"}
